DIGILYTE POLYMER WEBSITE
========================
Included pages:
- index.html (Home)
- products.html (Product categories)
- about.html (About)
- contact.html (Contact and enquiry form)
- style.css (Responsive premium dark/3D-inspired design)
- script.js (Mobile navigation and email enquiry form)

HOW TO PREVIEW
1. Extract this ZIP file.
2. Open index.html in a browser.

FREE HOSTING
Recommended: GitHub Pages (free static website hosting).
1. Create/sign in to a GitHub account.
2. Create a new PUBLIC repository, e.g. digilyte-polymer.
3. Upload all files from this folder to the repository root.
4. Open Settings > Pages.
5. Under Build and deployment, choose Deploy from a branch.
6. Select main and /(root), then Save.
7. GitHub will provide a free URL like https://USERNAME.github.io/digilyte-polymer/

NOTES
- Free hosting gives you a platform subdomain, not a free custom .com domain.
- The enquiry form opens the visitor's email app; it does not store submissions.
- Product categories are based on the DigiLyte Polymer product catalogue. Prices are intentionally not shown because current prices/availability should be confirmed directly.
- Confirm business address, GST details, product images, and any claims before publishing.
